P['C4_U_Lemon'] = P_("A flat, harsh phone-flash photo of a messy Indian kitchen counter at night: a cut half lemon, a steel spoon, a salt packet. A yellow sticky note is stuck on the lemon, written in thick black marker in capitals: \"STOP PUTTING LEMON ON YOUR TEETH.\" Next to it on the counter, " + TRIO + ", with a second sticky note on the powder jar in black marker: \"use this. buy 2 get 1 free\". Slightly crooked framing. That is ALL the text.", 'U')
